<title>JAPAN: Itochu Warehouse - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Itochu Warehouse - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.57		vs	   12.56</p>
<p> Operating	  271    mln	  vs	  418    mln</p>
<p> Current	    343    mln	  vs	  463    mln</p>
<p> Net		  175    mln	  vs	  210    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    6.01 yen	  vs	    7.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Itochu Warehouse Co Ltd is a warehousing, transport and international cargo handling firm.</p>
